sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant WebUI as Web Interface
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant Servers as AI Servers
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>WebUI: Start Benchmark
    WebUI->>Orch: POST /api/benchmark/start
    
    Note over Orch,Servers: Phase 1: Preflight & Warmup
    Orch->>Servers: Verify Connectivity & Warmup
    
    Note over Orch,Servers: Phase 2: Benchmark Execution
    loop During Scenario
        par Hardware Telemetry
            Orch->>Servers: Monitor CPU/GPU/RAM
        and Inference Generation
            Orch->>Servers: Generate Load (oha/locust/vllm-bench)
        end
        Orch->>DB: Save Results & Snapshots
    end
    
    Note over Orch,DB: Phase 3: Finalize & Report
    Orch->>DB: Compare performance & Identify Winner
    Orch-->>WebUI: Mark Completed
    WebUI-->>User: Display Report & Graphs
